flowchart LR
  accTitle: Grafana Cloud backup freshness monitoring
  accDescr {
    Backend source implements durable backup success and 30-hour freshness metrics. Infra source
    stages the same safe last-success behavior for the home-server exporter, but the live home
    exporter remains unmanaged until protected deployment. Grafana never substitutes last-run age.
  }
  HomeLive["Live home exporter: unmanaged\nlast-success timestamp unavailable"] --> Grafana["Grafana Cloud dashboard"]
  HomeStaged["Infra-staged home exporter\nnot deployed"] --> Grafana
  Backend["Backend source: durable last success\nand 30-hour freshness"] --> Grafana
  Grafana --> Evaluate{"Last run succeeded AND\nlast success age under 30 hours?"}
  Evaluate -->|"No or unavailable"| Alert["Operations backup alert"]
  Evaluate -->|"Yes"| Healthy["Fresh successful evidence"]
  Healthy --> Resolve["Resolve prior alert"]
  HomeStaged --> Apply["Protected deploy and fresh query\nstill required"]
